WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.610
Dad! Mom!

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.160
Look, look! It's such a pretty shell!

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:14.360
That's a cherry blossom shell.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.120
Yeah, it really is pretty, Aiko.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.000
'Kay Dad, I'm leavin' now.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.050
The weather's nice today too.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:08.060
May the gods bless us with good business and good health today.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.060
Aiko!

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:13.020
Jeez, what're ya doin'? Ya forgot this.

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:17.200
I almost forgot the clothes for my favorite class, PE.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.240
Thank you, Dad.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.450
I still say that ya can't beat anyone at anything 'cept PE.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:22.910
How rude.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.450
You underestimate me.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.120
Ohhh, what an attitude.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.540
Then what else are you better than other people at?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.920
Linguistics? Math?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.130
I can eat faster than anyone else.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.170
Stop jokin' around.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.760
Okay, I'm going now.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.550
Yeah. Take care now.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.730
Ai-chan!

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:56.100
Good morning!

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.900
Hey, Doremi-chan, today we absolutely hafta beat the boys in dodgeball.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.200
We'll definitely win with Ai-chan playing.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.080
Yep.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.120
Aiko...

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.270
I Want to See Mom!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.260
Oh no, I'm late again.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.390
I'm sorry.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.230
Are you okay? Are you hurt anywhere?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:34.860
No...

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.690
Thank goodness.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:42.240
Are you a third grader at this elementary school?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.450
Yes...

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.420
Sugiyama.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.590
How many times do I have to tell you to stop being tardy?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.210
Looks like I dropped the ball! Like a ball-erina!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.050
Something like that.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.680
So cold...

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.850
Sugiyama, go run 10 laps!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:18.690
Kotake looked so funny when Ai-chan hit him in the face with the ball.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.990
Ai-chan's throw was so powerful.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:23.400
My heart was beating so fast.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.900
All the boys were shaking in their boots at such a powerful throw!

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.790
Thanks, thanks!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.660
HEEEEEEYYYYY!!!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.370
Do you think you have time for such idle chat?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.090
Your head will burst with so many outbursts.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.050
Whose fault do you think that is!?

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.430
Here I am, being all flexible...

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.970
Majo Rika, we have a customer.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.970
Oh, it's Sugiyama.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.390
What's up?

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:53.940
I have a letter for Senoo.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.140
A letter fer me?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.190
Don't tell me it's...

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:57.940
A love letter?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:00.320
D-Don't say such stupid things!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.070
Someone wanted me to give this to Senoo this morning!

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.400
A lady with an Osaka accent.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.240
A lady with...

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:06.860
An Osaka accent!?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.080
Let me see that letter.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.040
Senoo Aiko-sama

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.290
Atsuko

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.850
Why didn't ya give this to me before school ended!?

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:39.310
I wanted to give it to you this morning, but I had to run laps.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.730
You retard!

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:44.400
What's wrong with you? I came all the way here to give it to you.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.200
You're too late!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.320
Ai-chan!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:47.950
What's wrong?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.280
Ai-

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.240
chan?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.410
Senoo...

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.620
My mom...

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.250
She came to see me.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.260
Your mom, who you haven't seen since the divorce?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.430
She said she could see me before five o'clock.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.050
Senoo, I'm sorry.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.310
I didn't know about this at all.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:18.140
Ai-chan, maybe your mom is still waiting for you.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.190
I think you should go check it out.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:21.520
Hurry!

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.900
I'm really sorry, Senoo.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.450
Aiko, are you doing well?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:41.700
I wrote more than 100 letters, but you never wrote back.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.170
So, I came to see you.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:49.220
I don't think your dad wanted you to see my letters.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.930
But, I really want to see you, Aiko.

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.740
I want to hug you.

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:58.020
Mom...

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:04.940
I have to take the six o'clock Shinkansen back to Osaka because of work.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.280
But I'll be in Misora City before five o'clock.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:11.450
Please come to the Misora train station after school.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.740
Mom will be waiting there.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.500
Mom!

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:32.430
Aiko, it looks like you still can't forgive me.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.720
Atsuko.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.530
Mom... That's not true.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:38.180
That's not true...

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.430
That's not true, Mom!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.530
Ai-chan, where's your mom?

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:55.990
If she's not here, then she's at the Tokyo main station.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:56.990
It's all his fault...

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.450
I'm gonna beat the crap out of him!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.080
A-Ai-chan?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:04.290
Sugiyama's apologized already.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.920
And he didn't do it on purpose.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.170
Not Sugiyama, but my dad.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.630
Why!?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:16.140
Even if yer my dad, that was too much!

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.600
Why didn't ya let me see Mom's letters?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.600
Are ya listenin'!?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.400
She... She wrote that many?

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.610
I never opened them.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:40.200
I thought you'd get even sadder if ya ever saw 'em...

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.290
That's why I never showed 'em to ya.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.750
You worry too much, you stupid dad!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.960
I can't stand this place anymore!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.220
Don't stop me.

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.180
I really mean it when I say I'm leavin'!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.680
Where ya goin'?

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:04.140
It doesn't work that way, ya idiot.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:08.900
Oh, I see. Do whatever ya want then!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.540
Yes, I will, thank you very much!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.110
A-Aiko!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.990
Thank you so much for your care.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.700
Okay! Goodbye!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.050
Mimi, are ya tryin' to comfort me?

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.390
Thank you, but what should I do now?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:44.310
I left home, but I've got no idea where to go.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.230
Ai-chan?

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.190
It is you, Ai-chan.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.360
What are you doing here?

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:01.080
Ai-chan?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.930
Yes, that's right.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:30.410
I think Ai-chan will calm down after a good rest here.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:33.690
Yes, yes, sorry to bother you.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.240
Your dad says it's okay.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.320
Yeah?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.450
Well then, sorry to bother you.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:48.300
What are you saying, aren't we best friends?

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.460
I'll always be on your side.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:52.210
Thank you.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.750
Doremi-chan?

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.420
Yes?

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.840
Yer mother is a very kind person.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.340
Ai-chan, your mom is too.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:05.810
She wrote so many letters to you and she came here today to see you.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:10.520
But adults are so hard to understand.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:15.480
Your dad is so kind, so why did your parents divorce?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.190
It's probably 'cause of me.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:24.550
When we were in Osaka, my dad worked fer the same taxi company.

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.250
And my mom's job is bein' a nurse at a retirement center.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:36.380
One time, when they both were gone at work, I was playin' by myself on the jungle gym.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.010
I accidentally fell and badly hurt myself.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:44.670
It's because she was all alone that this happened.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:47.350
Hey, Atsuko, can ya stop workin'?

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.160
I can't.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:52.310
If I stopped, who would take care of the old folks?

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:55.060
Ya hafta find someone to replace you!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.020
Don'tcha think it's too hard on Aiko?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.780
Please, answer me!

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.700
You won't answer me even if I beg you like this!?

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.490
Dad, stop fightin'!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.160
Aiko ain't lonely by herself...

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:12.540
Aiko. Yer a good kid, y'know?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:16.630
Do you think those old people are more important than yer own child!?

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.460
That's not true!

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:20.090
It's just...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:28.760
After that, my dad and mom would fight every time they met.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.770
After all that, they got a divorce.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.800
So that's how it happened...

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:38.270
But my mom wanted to take me with her.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:46.780
Mom! Dad looks so sad!

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.160
Take him with us!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:49.840
I can't do that.

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:51.370
Why!?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.020
Why can't you do that!?

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.460
I wanna be with Dad!

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:58.710
Dad!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.840
Aiko!

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.720
Aiko...

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.930
Who'll make dinner for Dad?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.220
Who'll do his laundry?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:13.020
Mom, please take Dad with us.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.730
Okay then, Aiko, stay and take care of Dad.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.690
Mom!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:25.200
Okay?

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.870
Please.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.490
Mom!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.330
Aiko!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.800
Mom!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:40.380
I still remember my mom's back when that happened.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.590
I really wanted to see my mom today.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.090
Then why don't you go see her?

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.970
We can use magic for this!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:52.970
Okay? Let's go.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.930
Osaka is just a short flight away.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:57.810
Yer right.

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:00.440
Alright, let's go to Osaka!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:04.400
Mt. Fuji is so pretty.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.860
This is the first time we've flown so far on our brooms.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:10.870
Ai-chan, I really hope we can see your mother.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.120
Y-Yeah.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.500
Eh? She ain't here?

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:19.170
Well, she left with Doremi early this morning.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.380
They probably went to Osaka.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.340
How will they get there without money?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.050
I think that's very possible.

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:34.470
Sorry to bother ya! Please excuse me!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:44.570
Mom lives in Hannan City, which is that way.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.480
Okay, let's go.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.600
Wait.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:49.950
We can probably find her at work now.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.560
Oh yeah.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.230
Ai-chan, where does your mom work?

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.610
I'm not sure.

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:57.700
She never wrote about that in her letters.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.640
We can use Magical Stage for this.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:02.710
That's it!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.260
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:13.140
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.480
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.700
Magical Stage!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.040
-Please tell me where Mom is workin' at!
-Please tell us where Ai-chan's mother works at!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.800
Why a bench?

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.140
Another failure?

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.470
Um...

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.380
What's up, ma'am?

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:59.930
I'm lookin' fer my old man, but I ain't got a clue what street he's on.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.770
Let me see that map.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.770
Ah, it's this way.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.330
Ai-chan?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.570
Aren't you looking for someone yourself?

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:11.780
That's Ai-chan for you.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.610
Here's the place, ma'am.

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:16.070
Thanks so much.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:19.410
Honey! Honey, I'm over here.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.740
Ahh, my darling, I'm comin' right now!

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.060
Honey?

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:25.920
Darling?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.840
Hey, isn't this place a retirement center?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.220
It looks that way.

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:46.650
Ai-chan, don't tell me...

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:49.610
Is that beautiful lady your mother?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.150
Magical Stage worked!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.320
What are you doing? Hurry up and go see her.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:58.780
It's so sudden! I ain't feelin' up to it.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:00.790
Mom...

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.340
Why do I remember my dad right now?

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:16.800
I thought you'd get even sadder if ya ever saw 'em...

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.810
What's wrong, Ai-chan?

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:25.250
I feel all embarrassed right now, so let's wait a bit.

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:29.770
Since we came all the way to Osaka, let me show ya girls around.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.610
Let's go, let's go.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.540
Geriatric Care Center - Smile Smile Home

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.540
What's wrong? You came out so fast.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:54.090
Well, my mom worked the early shift, so she went home already.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.550
It's all because you took us sightseeing around Osaka.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.720
Something's weird with you, Ai-chan.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.960
N-No there ain't.

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:04.180
Well, since we know where she lives, let's go see her.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.900
Between 3rd and 15th... I think it's around here.

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:14.860
Found it.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.920
Aozora Village, right? Which number?

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:18.570
Number 3.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.240
Ah! Over there.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.200
That room where her uniform is hung up outside.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.910
Ai-chan, hurry up and go see her.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.250
Yeah, okay!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.090
Be brave!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.050
Ai-chan, fight!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:43.970
What's wrong?

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.270
Someone's comin'.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:50.100
Now, now, now, don't cry, don't cry.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:53.110
Why is Mom holdin' a baby?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.530
Daddy is comin' home soon.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:56.570
Please don't cry.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:58.820
Daddy?

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:02.990
Ai-chan.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.200
Mom...

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.250
Remarried.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.500
Ai-chan, wait!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.590
Ai-chan...

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:24.390
Mom... ain't my own mom anymore!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:32.560
This is too much! We came all the way to Osaka to see her!

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.690
Yeah...

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.820
What a pain... You both are cryin' too.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.580
I stopped cryin' already.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.420
Yer faces look ridiculous.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.930
Thank you so much for always helpin' me, Okamura-san.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:06.890
It's nothin'. We should help each other out when we're in trouble.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.850
Right, Takashi-kun?

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:11.980
My wife just had to get a cold when I'm so busy.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:14.240
I dunno how I'm gonna handle all this.

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:14.860
Later.

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:35.290
My parents used to take me here to this beach all the time.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:41.020
I have good memories of all the places I took you girls this morning.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:44.480
Thanks to you two, I finally get it.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.260
Thank you.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:50.930
Doremi-chan, Hadzuki-chan, I'm so glad I'm friends with the two of ya.

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:52.640
Ai-chan!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:55.600
Okay, stop. Enough cryin'.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:58.460
Now, d'ya know the name of this place?

00:20:58.460 --> 00:20:59.360
Nope.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.570
It's called Pretty-Pretty Beach.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:03.530
Pretty-Pretty Beach?

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:07.740
Since so many pretty girls come here, they call it Pretty-Pretty Beach.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.410
It's one of Osaka's best hidden lil treasures.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.500
I see, I see.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:17.420
Dad!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.460
I knew you'd be here.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:26.190
What're ya doin' slackin' off? Ya big idiot.

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:28.260
Well, I... Uhm...

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:31.970
Ya thought I'd go runnin' off to Mom, so ya came to find me, right?

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.980
Well, t-that's...

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:34.940
Jeez!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:40.650
Yer such an idiotic dad, comin' all the way to Osaka to find me. How could I ever leave ya?

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.360
You...

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:52.490
Doremi-chan, Hadzuki-chan, let's ride Dad's taxi back.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.040
Okay!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.210
I still can't believe it!

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:06.680
Segawa Onpu-chan, the famous idol, transfers to our school!

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:10.890
Yeah, I thought idols were all snobby, but Onpu-chan's actually really nice.

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:14.020
She's so nice and cute that there's nothing to complain about her!

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.350
Oh, no! This is bad! Take a look at this!

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:18.440
Ah! It's Onpu-chan with a Witch Frog!

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.310
Don't tell me she's...

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:20.150
Could she possibly be...

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.570
Majo Rika's relative!?

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:22.730
Wait what?

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:23.880
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:26.090
The Transfer Student is a Witch Apprentice!?

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:28.820
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
